  "prefLabel": "He-W 820.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 820.01 Purpose. These rules describe the treatment of transfers of assets. When an individual applies for or receives nursing facility (NF), medical assistance or any category of home and community based care (HCBC) waiver services, the department of health and human services (DHHS) will use these rules to determine if that individual transferred, assigned, or disposed of the ownership of an asset within the look back period in accordance with 42 USC 1396p(c).\n\nSource. #12217, eff 6-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
}
